		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>No s'ha pogut reconèixer la finestra nova de «%@» (s'ha vist Claude a %lld de %lld pestanyes): mira-la a Warp abans de tornar-la a obrir.</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>Couldn't recognize the new window of “%@” (Claude was seen in %lld of %#@p@): check it in Warp before opening it again.</string>
